   If you have an OpenVMS AXP license, you are already licensed for the
   POSIX environment, and POSIX contains -- among many other common UNIX
   tools -- lex and yacc.

   POSIX is available for various OpenVMS AXP and OpenVMS VAX releases.
   It is a seperately installed kit -- the kit is available on the CDROM
